  "next_data_targets":[
    "Expand every country from identity-only into institutional, fiscal, energy, trade, demographic and infrastructure records.",
    "Expand every belief tradition into origin, texts, schools, institutions, geography and historical splits.",
    "Expand every major infrastructure corridor into endpoints, operators, owners, capacity and dependencies.",
    "Expand every major economic sector into inputs, outputs, firms, labour, finance and trade.",
    "Expand every major historical event into participants, causes, consequences, dates, places and sources.",
    "Expand every major Potatoism symbol into definition, canonical appearances, relationships, chronology and interpretation boundaries.",
    "Create reciprocal edges wherever a relationship is currently represented only in one direction.",
    "Create comparison records where two domains share a structural pattern but differ materially.",
    "Create negative-space records for important unknowns instead of silently omitting them.",
    "Turn every audit failure into a repair record and every repair record into a future validation check."
  ],
  "integrity":[
    "All IDs must be stable and unique within their namespace.",
    "Unknown is not zero.",
    "A symbolic correspondence must not be represented as historical causation without evidence.",
    "A country-level relationship must not be projected onto every individual in that country.",
    "An organization being connected to a sector does not imply ownership or ideological alignment.",
    "Every empirical measurement should carry date and provenance when available.",
    "Every important route target must resolve to a canonical record or documented future target.",
    "Every multiplication round must add information rather than merely duplicate existing records."
  ]
